# Explicit, reviewed exemptions for publish-gate.sh.
#
# Format:  <path><TAB><class><TAB><reason>
#
# Every applied exemption is printed on each run, and an entry that matches no
# finding fails the gate — so an exemption can neither be silent nor outlive the
# thing it excuses.

